ial Manager"},{"text":"Risk Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Qualified Actuary"},{"text":"Appointed Actuary"},{"text":"Chief Actuary"},{"text":"Head of Actuarial"},{"text":"Head of Risk"},{"text":"Chief Risk Officer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Specific regulated titles and responsibilities depend on professional qualification and applicable regulation."},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers Usually Test"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial mathematics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Insurance concepts"},{"text":"Actuarial mathematics"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"R/Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Logical reasoning"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Problem solving"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Scenario"},{"type":"note","label":"Scenario","text":"An insurer observes that claims have increased significantly in a particular customer segment."},{"type":"p","text":"An Actuarial Trainee should:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Validate the claims data."},{"text":"Check claim frequency."},{"text":"Check average claim severity."},{"text":"Compare historical periods."},{"text":"Segment by age/location/product/risk characteristics."},{"text":"Investigate changes in exposure."},{"text":"Analyse inflation and medical/repair costs where relevant."},{"text":"Identify changes in underwriting characteristics."},{"text":"Estimate the effect on expected losses."},{"text":"Evaluate pricing implications."},{"text":"Run sensitivity scenarios."},{"text":"Document assumptions and limitations."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to distinguish random fluctuation from a genuine change in underlying risk."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public-sector insurance"},{"text":"Government-backed insurance schemes"},{"text":"Pension and social-security programmes"},{"text":"Fina